    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p23-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the points of intersection of the graphs of $y=x^3$ and $y=(x-1)^3+4$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt5}{2},\\,2-\\sqrt5\\right)$ and $\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt5}{2},\\,2+\\sqrt5\\right)$.",
          "worked": "At an intersection, the two values of $y$ are equal.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^3&=(x-1)^3+4\\\\x^3&=x^3-3x^2+3x+3\\\\3x^2-3x-3&=0\\\\x^2-x-1&=0\\\\x&=\\frac{1\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x^2=x+1$ at these points,\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=x^3\\\\y&=x(x+1)\\\\y&=2x+1\\\\y&=2\\pm\\sqrt5.\\end{align*}$$\nThe intersection points are $\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt5}{2},2-\\sqrt5\\right)$ and $\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt5}{2},2+\\sqrt5\\right)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the values of $a$ for which the graph of $y=x^3$ intersects the graph of $y=(x-a)^3+a$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-2\\le a\\le2$.\n\nEquate the functions and require a non-negative quadratic discriminant when $a\\ne0$; when $a=0$, the graphs coincide.",
          "worked": "At an intersection,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^3&=(x-a)^3+a\\\\x^3&=x^3-3ax^2+3a^2x-a^3+a\\\\3ax^2-3a^2x+a^3-a&=0\\\\a(3x^2-3ax+a^2-1)&=0.\\end{align*}$$\nWhen $a=0$, the graphs coincide, so this value is included.\n\nWhen $a\\ne0$, intersections exist exactly when $3x^2-3ax+a^2-1=0$ has real solutions.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=(-3a)^2-4(3)(a^2-1)\\\\\\Delta&=12-3a^2.\\end{align*}$$\nThus\n$$\\begin{align*}12-3a^2&\\ge0\\\\a^2&\\le4\\\\-2\\le a&\\le2.\\end{align*}$$\nIncluding $a=0$, the required values are $-2\\le a\\le2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 80
      }
    ]
  },
